(ROOT/'README.md').write_text('# Saudi Floral Atelier — ten independent proposals\n\nUnofficial Arabic RTL website proposals for ten Saudi flower/gift businesses. Not endorsed by the shops. Stock images are clearly identified. No payments, reservations or invented prices.\n\nLive index: '+base+'/\n\n'+ '\n'.join('- ['+s['name']+' — '+s['city']+']('+base+'/'+s['slug']+'/)' for s in shops)+'\n\n## Research and audit\nSee research.json and research.html for sources, queries, limitations, and duplicate-check scope. 1,189 repository metadata entries and 166 relevant repository contents checked; four spa repositories inaccessible. No identity match found. Does not prove absence of a website or prior work outside accessible history.\n\n## Development\nRun `python3 build.py` after changing research.json or the generator. Run `python3 -m http.server 8765` for preview. Static output works on GitHub Pages with root deployment.\n\n## Assets\nLocal Pexels photos: assets/image-credits.json. Local Google Fonts under SIL OFL. No tracking, no form data storage.\n')
